---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Base title="About AI Game Mashups" description="AI Game Mashups is a free, open-source hub for playing clean-room game mashups and documenting the history of AI game mashups." crumbs={[{ name: 'About', path: '/about/' }]}>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>AI Game Mashups does two things: it hosts game mashups you can play instantly in a browser, and it documents the AI game mashup trend as it happens, checking every entry against its source code.</p>
    <p>It's made by <a href="https://nak.as">Andrew Nakas</a>, who also runs <a href="https://decompgames.com">Decomp Games</a> (decompilations and engine recreations in the browser) and <a href="https://skatemods.com">Skate Mods</a>. The site and GameMash are open source.</p>
    <h2>Contribute</h2>
    <p>Everything happens on GitHub. To add a mashup to the history, fix a fact or propose a preset, <a href={`${SITE.repo}/issues/new/choose`}>open an issue</a> or send a pull request. See <a href={`${SITE.repo}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md`}>CONTRIBUTING.md</a>.</p>
    <h2>Takedowns and corrections</h2>
    <p>If you're a rights holder or a creator listed here and something is wrong, <a href={`${SITE.repo}/issues/new?template=correction.yml`}>open a correction</a>. We fix factual errors quickly.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
